    "chunk_text": "\u00f0onne o\u00f0re menn, \u00f0onne wile he hiene ascadan from Ac hie sceoldon gehieran \u00f0one cuide \u00f0e sio So\u00f0f\u00e6s\u00f0nes self cw\u00e6\u00f0, he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Habba\u00f0 sealt on \u00d0\u00e6t sealt he nemde for wisdom, for\u00f0\u00e6m he wolde \u00f0\u00e6t we h\u00e6fden \u00e6g\u00f0er ge sibbe ge wisdom, For\u00f0\u00e6m sua sua he bet wat, swa he wyrs agylt, & maran demm gedrih\u00f0 him selfum mid \u00f0\u00e6m He m\u00e6g hine \u00f0y l\u00e6s beladian \u00f0\u00e6t he n\u00e6bbe wite geearno\u00f0 \u00f0y he meahte mid his wisdome Ac him w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e ryhte to gecueden \u00f0urh Iacobus \u00f0one apostol, he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Gif ge h\u00e6bben For\u00f0\u00e6m se wisdom nis ufan cumen of hefenum, ac he is eor\u00f0lic & wildiorlic & eac diofullic. Ac se se \u00f0e of Gode cym\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 godes willan & gesibsum. \u00d0\u00e6t is \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t he sie cl\u00e6nes willan & goodes, \u00f0\u00e6t he cl\u00e6nlice & ryhtwislice ongiete \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t \u00d0\u00e6t is \u00f0onne \u00f0\u00e6t he gesibsum sie, \u00f0\u00e6t he hiene nanwuht ne ahebbe ofer his gelican, ne from \u00d0\u00e6m ungesibsuman is to cy\u00f0anne \u00f0\u00e6t hie wieten \u00f0\u00e6tte swa lange sua hie beo\u00f0 from \u00f0\u00e6re lufe Be \u00f0\u00e6m is awriten on Cristes bocum: Gif \u00f0u wille \u00f0in lac bringan to \u00f0\u00e6m wiofude, & \u00f0u \u00f0onne L\u00e6t inc geseman \u00e6r \u00f0u \u00f0in lac bringe; Brieng si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00f0in lac",
